State employees-authorizing semimonthly pay
HB0306
periods.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Singh
AN ACT relating to the administration of the government; authorizing state
employees to choose whether to be paid semimonthly as specified; making
conforming amendments; specifying duties of the state auditor; specifying
applicability; and providing for effective dates.
